SUMMARY:T4\, T4A and T5 slips and summaries due to the CRA
DESCRIPTION:File the T4 and T4A summaries and give employees their slips.
  T5s for dividends paid during the year are due the same day. Who: Emplo
 yers\; corporations that paid dividends. If a due date falls on a Saturd
 ay\, Sunday or public holiday\, the CRA treats it as on time if received
  the next business day. More: https://www.ghayurtax.com/key-dates.html
