DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270315
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270316
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:Ontario Employer Health Tax annual return
DESCRIPTION:Due March 15 for the previous calendar year. Employers with O
 ntario payroll under the exemption usually do not have to file — check
  with us if unsure. Who: Employers who file EHT. If a due date falls on 
 a Saturday\, Sunday or public holiday\, the CRA treats it as on time if 
 received the next business day. More: https://www.ghayurtax.com/key-date
 s.html
URL:https://www.ghayurtax.com/key-dates.html
