SUMMARY:T3 trust returns and T5013 partnership returns
DESCRIPTION:T3 returns and slips are due 90 days after the trust's year-e
 nd (March 31 for December year-ends\; March 30 in a leap year). T5013 pa
 rtnership returns are due March 31 for most partnerships. Who: Trusts wi
 th a December year-end\; most partnerships. If a due date falls on a Sat
 urday\, Sunday or public holiday\, the CRA treats it as on time if recei
 ved the next business day. More: https://www.ghayurtax.com/key-dates.htm
 l
